{
  "name": "AIPP \u00b7 11 \u00b7 SOP / Runbook Generator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "aipp-sop",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {
          "responseData": "allEntries"
        }
      },
      "id": "5c0bba6b-c146-5baf-8620-60342317daaa",
      "name": "AIPP \u00b7 Incident Closed Hook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.0,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "trace-1",
              "name": "traceId",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id + '-' + $now.toMillis() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "trace-2",
              "name": "startedAt",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "trace-3",
              "name": "workflow",
              "value": "={{ $workflow.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c18701e8-2c18-5943-a28a-1303e392fe22",
      "name": "Init Trace",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        380,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sop-1",
              "name": "incident_id",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.incident_id || $json.incident_id || $json.body?.commonLabels?.alertname || 'INC-88392') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-2",
              "name": "incident_title",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.incident_title || $json.body?.title || $json.body?.commonAnnotations?.summary || $json.body?.commonLabels?.alertname || 'PostgreSQL Connection Pool Exhaustion & Outage') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-3",
              "name": "severity",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.severity || $json.body?.commonLabels?.severity || 'CRITICAL').toUpperCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-4",
              "name": "affected_service",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.affected_service || $json.body?.commonLabels?.pod || $json.body?.commonLabels?.instance || $json.body?.service || 'AIPP Backend API / PostgreSQL Cluster') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-5",
              "name": "rca_summary",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.rca_summary || $json.body?.commonAnnotations?.summary || 'Database connection pool exhaustion under peak load') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-6",
              "name": "timeline",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.timeline || 'T0 14:10 Alert Fired -> T1 14:15 Triage -> T2 14:35 Pool Scaled -> T3 14:52 Mitigated') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sop-7",
              "name": "should_generate_sop",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.generate_sop === true || ($json.body?.severity || $json.body?.commonLabels?.severity || 'CRITICAL').toLowerCase().includes('crit') || ($json.body?.severity || '').toLowerCase().includes('sev1') || ($json.body?.severity || '').toLowerCase().includes('p1') || $json.body?.trigger_type === 'incident_closed' || (!$json.body?.severity && !$json.body?.commonLabels?.severity)) ? 'true' : 'false' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8df0bce0-c27d-5610-baa8-8f6d41ff5568",
      "name": "Extract Incident Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "if-eq",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.should_generate_sop }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "6af1d18e-e047-5d0b-aa42-30af73a52198",
      "name": "Critical or Closed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://192.168.88.22:30801/api/workflows/rca/docx",
        "method": "POST",
        "sendBody": true,
        "options": {},
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"incident_id\": \"={{ $('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_id }}\", \"title\": \"={{ $('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_title }}\", \"affected_service\": \"={{ $('Extract Incident Context').item.json.affected_service }}\", \"severity\": \"={{ $('Extract Incident Context').item.json.severity }}\", \"summary\": \"={{ $('Extract Incident Context').item.json.rca_summary }}\"}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer AMS2zaOxP9t4aMgsn0IcMsKjOx3EkcvEOrIC_H61SXvD4gborHjoH4pJjieedloP"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "14d08191-76d8-526b-9bd8-1436e164dab1",
      "name": "Generate .DOCX Runbook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You draft enterprise SRE runbooks and post-mortems. Structure: 1. Symptom & Metric Trigger, 2. Diagnosis Steps (with exact CLI commands), 3. Fix & Mitigation (with rollback steps), 4. Long-term Prevention. Markdown only."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "Incident ID: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_id}}\nTitle: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_title}}\nSeverity: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.severity}}\nImpacted Service: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.affected_service}}\nRCA: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.rca_summary}}\nTimeline: {{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.timeline}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": true,
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "717eb763-d005-5918-9a56-5851c4e70605",
      "name": "AI \u00b7 Draft Runbook",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        1100,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenAI account 4"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "aipp",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=\ud83d\udcd8 *SRE Runbook & RCA (.DOCX) Generated for incident `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_id}}`*\n\n\u2022 *Incident Topic:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_title}}`\n\u2022 *Affected Service:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.affected_service}}`\n\u2022 *Severity:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.severity}}`\n\u2022 *Root Cause:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.rca_summary}}`\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 *Microsoft Word File Generated:* `docs/Incident_PostMortem_RCA_{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_id}}.docx`\n\ud83d\udd17 *Download Link:* `/docs/Incident_PostMortem_RCA_{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_id}}.docx`\n\nPreview:\n{{$json.message.content}}\n\nReply `publish` to push to Wiki.\n\n_trace: `{{ $('Init Trace').item.json.traceId || 'n/a' }}`_",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "ca8709a8-77cd-55a0-9669-c78b67bc5b50",
      "name": "Slack \u00b7 Review Runbook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Slack account 4"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "aipp",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=\u2139\ufe0f *Alert Recorded \u2014 SOP Generation Skipped*\n\n\u2022 *Alert Topic:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.incident_title}}`\n\u2022 *Affected Service:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.affected_service}}`\n\u2022 *Severity:* `{{$('Extract Incident Context').item.json.severity}}` (Non-Critical)\n\n_Note: SRE Post-Mortem & SOP runbooks are automatically generated only for P1/Critical incidents or upon incident closure to avoid document fatigue._\n\n_trace: `{{ $('Init Trace').item.json.traceId || 'n/a' }}`_",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "d46d13e3-274f-5b71-a334-9c7c540bffc8",
      "name": "Slack \u00b7 Low Severity Alert Recorded",
